OL,3,GNEWSAParking fee hikes drive shoppers
OL,4,Aaway, warn traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are parking in Shrewsbury for
OL,7,Fless time and spending less money
OL,8,Fbecause of rising charges, business
OL,9,Fleaders say.
OL,11,FThe number of hours parked in
OL,12,FShropshire Council car parks between
OL,13,FNovember and May fell by 9.7% compared
OL,14,Fto the same period in 2024/25, and the
OL,15,Fnumber of transactions fell by 2.3%,
OL,16,FShrewsbury Business Improvement
OL,17,FDistrict (BID) said.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
