OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAParking fee hikes drive shoppers
OL,4,Aaway, warn traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe increases, introduced a year ago,
OL,7,Fwere the first since 2022, and the
OL,8,Fauthority is running a consultation on
OL,9,Ffurther proposed rises - the BID said
OL,10,Fthey were "eye-watering".
OL,12,FHowever, Rob Wilson, cabinet member for
OL,13,Ftransport and regeneration, said
OL,14,Fmanaging parking helps keep town
OL,15,Fcentres accessible, reduces congestion
OL,16,Fand makes spaces available.
